# T2 — consonance: the inter-language agreement
zxapp 1
id consonance_t2
matrix 64
name Consonance T2
provides flags_none truth bits forbidden
logic kron flags_none <<
(_bits&_forbidden)=0
.
logic kron flags_none <<
(_bits|(_forbidden*2))<_forbidden
.
check flags_none bits=0,1,2,3 forbidden=0,1,2,3 = both
